  "title": "Coney Island Hot Dogs",
  "description": "Enjoy the famous Coney Island hot dogs at home with Chef John's recipe for the Detroit favorite with a rich meat sauce and fresh chopped onion.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
